{'symbol': 'DGX', 'date': '2023-02-01 13:27:00', 'title': 'FORTUNE MAGAZINE NAMES QUEST DIAGNOSTICS ONE OF 2023 "WORLD\'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES" FOR NINTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': "SECAUCUS, N.J. , FEB. 1, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- QUEST DIAGNOSTICS (NYSE: DGX), THE WORLD'S LEADING PROVIDER OF DIAGNOSTIC INFORMATION SERVICES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS BEEN SELECTED AS ONE OF FORTUNE'S\xa0WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES IN 2023\xa0FOR THE NINTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR."}